claim.claim-text:
1. An encoding apparatus comprising at least one processor comprising processor circuitry configured individually and/or collectively to:
encode, in a bitstream, a presence flag indicating that an initialization flag is not included in the bitstream;
for a slice of a picture, select initialization values for initializing an arithmetic coding;
based on the presence flag indicating that the initialization flag is not included in the bitstream, select a first set of initialization values in response to a slice type of the slice being a B slice type, and select a second set of initialization values in response to the slice type of the slice being a P slice type;
initialize the arithmetic coding using the selected initialization values; and
encode one or more syntax elements of the slice using the arithmetic coding.

5. A video encoding method comprising:
encoding, in a bitstream, a presence flag indicating that an initialization flag is not included in the bitstream;
for a slice of a picture, selecting initialization values for initializing an arithmetic coding;
based on the presence flag indicating that the initialization flag is not included in the bitstream, selecting a first set of initialization values in response to a slice type of the slice being a B slice type, and selecting a second set of initialization values in response to the slice type of the slice being a P slice type;
initializing the arithmetic coding using the selected initialization values; and
encoding one or more syntax elements of the slice using the arithmetic coding.

9. A decoding apparatus comprising at least one processor comprising processor circuitry configured individually and/or collectively to:
decode, from a bitstream, a presence flag indicating that an initialization flag is not included in the bitstream;
for a slice of a picture, select initialization values for initializing an arithmetic coding;
based on the presence flag indicating that the initialization flag is not included in the bitstream, select a first set of initialization values in response to a slice type of the slice being a B slice type, and select a second set of initialization values in response to the slice type of the slice being a P slice type;
initialize the arithmetic coding using the selected initialization values; and
decode one or more syntax elements of the slice using the arithmetic coding.

13. A video decoding method comprising:
decoding, from a bitstream, a presence flag indicating that an initialization flag is not included in the bitstream;
for a slice of a picture, selecting initialization values for initializing an arithmetic coding;
based on the presence flag indicating that the initialization flag is not included in the bitstream, selecting a first set of initialization values in response to a slice type of the slice being a B slice type, and selecting a second set of initialization values in response to the slice type of the slice being a P slice type;
initializing the arithmetic coding using the selected initialization values; and
decoding one or more syntax elements of the slice using the arithmetic coding.
